{
    "title": "All Document Reader Offline",
    "description": "Searching for Offline documents reader? Now easily view and read all documents using <b>Office viewer for Word, Pdf, Excel & PPT files</b>. It would be very useful for people who just simply want to read documents without any extra heavy features for editing. It is simple, lightweight app. It consumes less space into your phone. \r\n\r\n<b>Document Reader</b> \ud83d\udcd6 Manage all your documents. Now you can get the best manager for your phone that can assure you to read all the document files of all the extensions easily. All Document Reader \ud83d\udcda and Office Viewer allow you to view and read all document files on your mobile. You can open documents that are stored on the internal memory or even downloaded files or those sent as email attachments and you can open any document with this document file viewer when you are on any other app.\r\n\r\n<b>Main Features of All Document Reader Offline:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Document reader, All files reader and viewer\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Word file reader, Read your Docx files\r\n\ud83d\udc49 PDF Viewer, Read and view all PDF Files\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Text files reader, Read your Txt format files\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Fast and Beautiful Interface to view your documents.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Multiple document formats supported in one single application\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Quickly Search particular document using search option.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Mark your files as favorite\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Search particular document by name\r\n\ud83d\udc49 All documents well categories by file type like PDF, DOC/DOCX, PPT/PPTX, XLS/XLSX, Text.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 All the functionality of this Office Viewer you can access without internet as it is complete offline application.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Sorting: By name, date & size.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Quickly update the list with refresh button option\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccc Document Viewer / Document Reader</b>\r\nThe most used tools for working with word, sheet, slide, and text, PDF, ZIP and RAR all from a one application. You don\u2019t need to install multiple applications to open apps on different platforms.\r\nIt is complete office document reader that works offline.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccc PDF Viewer / PDF Reader Viewer</b>\r\nPDF file is now a day\u2019s most important part of document. You can do easily day by day activity like as News Paper reading, Business invoice view, traveling ticket read, Study notes etc. It is the right PDF reader for you. It can help you to easily manage and open all the PDF files on your mobile.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccc PPT Reader / View PPTX Slide</b>\r\nEasily browse & open PowerPoint and slides. If you\u2019re a preparing for slide presentation then use our mobile app to view and read ppt slides. If you are preparing for exam papers PowerPoint slides then prepare your exams from your android phone.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccc Excel Viewer - Excel Reader</b>\r\nRead all excel files in high quality with easy navigation option. Excel lets you read charts and spreadsheets to meet your specific needs.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccc Supported formats</b>\r\n- Word Document: DOC, DOCX, DOCS.\r\n- Excel Document: XLS, XLSX.\r\n- Slide Document: PPT, PPTX. \r\n\r\nDownload the <b>All Document Reader Offline<b> app today. Enjoy reading with the app \ud83d\udcda :)\r\nYour feedback is important to us. Write us on ivoicetranslate@gmail.com.</b></b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Searching for Offline documents reader? Now easily view and read all documents using <b>Office viewer for Word, Pdf, Excel &amp; PPT files</b>. It would be very useful for people who just simply want to read documents without any extra heavy features for editing. It is simple, lightweight app. It consumes less space into your phone. <br><br><b>Document Reader</b> \ud83d\udcd6 Manage all your documents. Now you can get the best manager for your phone that can assure you to read all the document files of all the extensions easily. All Document Reader \ud83d\udcda and Office Viewer allow you to view and read all document files on your mobile. You can open documents that are stored on the internal memory or even downloaded files or those sent as email attachments and you can open any document with this document file viewer when you are on any other app.<br><br><b>Main Features of All Document Reader Offline:</b><br><br>\ud83d\udc49 Document reader, All files reader and viewer<br>\ud83d\udc49 Word file reader, Read your Docx files<br>\ud83d\udc49 PDF Viewer, Read and view all PDF Files<br>\ud83d\udc49 Text files reader, Read your Txt format files<br>\ud83d\udc49 Fast and Beautiful Interface to view your documents.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Multiple document formats supported in one single application<br>\ud83d\udc49 Quickly Search particular document using search option.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Mark your files as favorite<br>\ud83d\udc49 Search particular document by name<br>\ud83d\udc49 All documents well categories by file type like PDF, DOC/DOCX, PPT/PPTX, XLS/XLSX, Text.<br>\ud83d\udc49 All the functionality of this Office Viewer you can access without internet as it is complete offline application.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Sorting: By name, date &amp; size.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Quickly update the list with refresh button option<br><br><br><b>\ud83d\udccc Document Viewer / Document Reader</b><br>The most used tools for working with word, sheet, slide, and text, PDF, ZIP and RAR all from a one application. You don\u2019t need to install multiple applications to open apps on different platforms.<br>It is complete office document reader that works offline.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udccc PDF Viewer / PDF Reader Viewer</b><br>PDF file is now a day\u2019s most important part of document. You can do easily day by day activity like as News Paper reading, Business invoice view, traveling ticket read, Study notes etc. It is the right PDF reader for you. It can help you to easily manage and open all the PDF files on your mobile.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udccc PPT Reader / View PPTX Slide</b><br>Easily browse &amp; open PowerPoint and slides. If you\u2019re a preparing for slide presentation then use our mobile app to view and read ppt slides. If you are preparing for exam papers PowerPoint slides then prepare your exams from your android phone.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udccc Excel Viewer - Excel Reader</b><br>Read all excel files in high quality with easy navigation option. Excel lets you read charts and spreadsheets to meet your specific needs.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udccc Supported formats</b><br>- Word Document: DOC, DOCX, DOCS.<br>- Excel Document: XLS, XLSX.<br>- Slide Document: PPT, PPTX. <br><br>Download the <b>All Document Reader Offline<b> app today. Enjoy reading with the app \ud83d\udcda :)<br>Your feedback is important to us. Write us on ivoicetranslate@gmail.com.</b></b>",
